{"2266120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "One More Airport", "steam_appid": 2266120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One More Airport is an airport management sim built around<strong> Hand-Crafted Scenarios</strong>. Each scenario drops you in a different setting with its own goals and unique mechanics. Of course you can also play<strong> Sandbox</strong>, optionally with unlimited funds. Build terminals, wire up logistics from baggage to aircraft servicing, schedule flights and keep thousands of passengers moving!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Hand-Crafted Scenarios</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scenario offers a fresh challenge with unique mechanics. Help ship disaster relief goods, go green as protesters mass at the gate or ensure logistics for the big concert-week are top nodge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/20355ce4c47b20a937fee13357c07df7.poster.avif?t=1786692861\" width=1170 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/20355ce4c47b20a937fee13357c07df7.webm?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/20355ce4c47b20a937fee13357c07df7.mp4?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the terminal of your dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layout a design for your terminal and scale from a single runway to a thriving international hub. Expand across multiple floors, design terminal interiors and build amenities for your passengers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/61b7646f185501716a8fa13c523269b3.poster.avif?t=1786692861\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/61b7646f185501716a8fa13c523269b3.webm?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/61b7646f185501716a8fa13c523269b3.mp4?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage flights, airlines and staffing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Schedule flights while keeping an eye on aircraft servicing and airline satisfaction, and ensure you have enough staff and service vehicles to keep up with demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/1ccf736a8219dde7d917a4eaee9774be.poster.avif?t=1786692861\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/1ccf736a8219dde7d917a4eaee9774be.webm?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/1ccf736a8219dde7d917a4eaee9774be.mp4?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design efficient logistical chains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and scale (self-service) check-in, security and boarding to prevent choke-points for your passengers. Arrange automated infrastructure for baggage, and watch your terminal thrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/739b9ad393de612452512f4667715948.poster.avif?t=1786692861\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/739b9ad393de612452512f4667715948.webm?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/739b9ad393de612452512f4667715948.mp4?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make a profit! Ehr, I mean, Keep passengers happy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of passengers visit your terminal every day and you'll need to work to keep them happy. Build restaurants, restrooms and shops. Shorten walks, cut queues and watch satisfaction climb. And best of all: a happy passenger is a spending passenger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/9b374d12652a3734989d0734a841c6b2.poster.avif?t=1786692861\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/9b374d12652a3734989d0734a841c6b2.webm?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/9b374d12652a3734989d0734a841c6b2.mp4?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scenario-driven play: </strong>hand-crafted challenges with unique mechanics and goals </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox mode</strong>:<strong> </strong>build and grow an efficient terminal, optionally with unlimited funds </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build: expand from a single runway to a multi-floor international hub</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage: schedule and service flights and take care of staffing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design: create efficient layouts for passengers, baggage, aircrafts and vehicles to optimize logistics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_strike\">Make a profit!</span> Keep passengers happy: it's all about those smiles, right?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the creator of One More Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One More Island was our island-builder; One More Airport is what's next - and we'd love for you to be part of it from the start. Wishlist now and follow along on Steam or Discord!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One More Airport is an airport management sim built around<strong> Hand-Crafted Scenarios</strong>. Each scenario drops you in a different setting with its own goals and unique mechanics. Of course you can also play<strong> Sandbox</strong>, optionally with unlimited funds. Build terminals, wire up logistics from baggage to aircraft servicing, schedule flights and keep thousands of passengers moving!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Hand-Crafted Scenarios</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scenario offers a fresh challenge with unique mechanics. Help ship disaster relief goods, go green as protesters mass at the gate or ensure logistics for the big concert-week are top nodge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/20355ce4c47b20a937fee13357c07df7.poster.avif?t=1786692861\" width=1170 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/20355ce4c47b20a937fee13357c07df7.webm?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/20355ce4c47b20a937fee13357c07df7.mp4?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the terminal of your dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layout a design for your terminal and scale from a single runway to a thriving international hub. Expand across multiple floors, design terminal interiors and build amenities for your passengers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/61b7646f185501716a8fa13c523269b3.poster.avif?t=1786692861\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/61b7646f185501716a8fa13c523269b3.webm?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/61b7646f185501716a8fa13c523269b3.mp4?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage flights, airlines and staffing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Schedule flights while keeping an eye on aircraft servicing and airline satisfaction, and ensure you have enough staff and service vehicles to keep up with demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/1ccf736a8219dde7d917a4eaee9774be.poster.avif?t=1786692861\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/1ccf736a8219dde7d917a4eaee9774be.webm?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/1ccf736a8219dde7d917a4eaee9774be.mp4?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design efficient logistical chains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and scale (self-service) check-in, security and boarding to prevent choke-points for your passengers. Arrange automated infrastructure for baggage, and watch your terminal thrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/739b9ad393de612452512f4667715948.poster.avif?t=1786692861\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/739b9ad393de612452512f4667715948.webm?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/739b9ad393de612452512f4667715948.mp4?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make a profit! Ehr, I mean, Keep passengers happy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of passengers visit your terminal every day and you'll need to work to keep them happy. Build restaurants, restrooms and shops. Shorten walks, cut queues and watch satisfaction climb. And best of all: a happy passenger is a spending passenger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/9b374d12652a3734989d0734a841c6b2.poster.avif?t=1786692861\" width=1170 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/9b374d12652a3734989d0734a841c6b2.webm?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/extras/9b374d12652a3734989d0734a841c6b2.mp4?t=1786692861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scenario-driven play: </strong>hand-crafted challenges with unique mechanics and goals </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox mode</strong>:<strong> </strong>build and grow an efficient terminal, optionally with unlimited funds </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build: expand from a single runway to a multi-floor international hub</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage: schedule and service flights and take care of staffing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design: create efficient layouts for passengers, baggage, aircrafts and vehicles to optimize logistics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_strike\">Make a profit!</span> Keep passengers happy: it's all about those smiles, right?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the creator of One More Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One More Island was our island-builder; One More Airport is what's next - and we'd love for you to be part of it from the start. Wishlist now and follow along on Steam or Discord!</p>", "short_description": "Every airport tells a different story. Play hand-crafted scenarios to ship disaster relief goods, go green as protesters mass at the gates, or play in Sandbox. Build efficient terminals, manage and service flights and design smooth logistic processes. Manage and master it all in One More Airport!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/a21d7cab6ea3cafa4b9be7cd04d4403b9a17aa95/header.jpg?t=1786692861", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/9a907cfad4276e01fe99691ab578ab133e4bd572/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786692861", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266120/9a907cfad4276e01fe99691ab578ab133e4bd572/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786692861", "website": "https://berggames.com/onemoreairport", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Int